  "construction": "One-block cyclic stabilizer code: generator X^a Z^b and its 28 cyclic shifts, a(x) = 1 + x^13 + x^14 + x^15, b(x) = 1 + x^11 + x^14 + x^17 in F_2[x]/(x^28 - 1); a = g p, b = g q with p, q palindromic so that a b* + b a* = 0; k = deg gcd(a, b, x^28 - 1)",
